   Q('mcq', 'What was the main advantage of chuño?', 'B', 'could be stored for years without spoiling', 'Chuño could be stored for years.', opts=['It tasted better than fresh potatoes.', 'It could be kept for a long time.', 'It was easy to grow in the mountains.', 'It was eaten only by soldiers.'], skill='detail'),
